{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13214040","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13214040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1321404001:1":{"text":"저기, 혹시 칼리프 가문 사람인가요?","source_cn":"小朋友，你是卡洛夫家的人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A9D6FA5DADB8787","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1321404002:1":{"text":"어떻게 아세요?\n...그런데 여러분은 시더 마을 사람들이 아닌 것 같은데요.","source_cn":"你们会怎么知道？\\n……你们也不像是雪松镇的人啊。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB4D9F41D9DC5FD88","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어떻게 아세요?\n...그런데 여러분은 시더 마을 사람들이 아닌 것 같은데요.","female":"어떻게 아세요?\n...그런데 여러분은 시더 마을 사람들이 아닌 것 같은데요.","variant_male_record_index":"150229","variant_female_record_index":"150230","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321404003:1":{"text":"카민스키 가문에 대해 들어본 적 있어요?","source_cn":"你听说过卡明斯基家族吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BC2C588444CC27F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321404004:1":{"text":"음... 형이 그 이름을 말했던 적이 있어요. 아마 먼 친척이라고 했던 것 같아요...","source_cn":"唔，我听我哥哥提起过，好像是关系很远的亲戚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA9B68FA252A6DC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321404005:1":{"text":"설마 그 가문 사람들이세요?","source_cn":"难道你们是那个家族的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27BB438E61AA0DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1321404005":{"text":"설마 그 가문 사람들이세요?","source_cn":"难道你们是那个家族的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27BB438E61AA0DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321404006:1":{"text":"좋아요! 하지만 저는 카민스키 가문이 저희 친척이라는 것만 알고 다른 건 몰라요.","source_cn":"好吧！不过，我只知道卡明斯基好像是我们家的亲戚，其余就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0118DF11FDC37F0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321404007:1":{"text":"아니면 저희 형에게 물어보세요! 아침에 <style=\"highlight\">영웅 얼음 조각상</style>을 보러 나갔거든요.","source_cn":"要不然，你们还是去问我哥哥吧！他早上出门去看<styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D018192DF737680","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321404008:1":{"text":"어라? 형이 발... 아니, 그 장군님을 동경하나요?","source_cn":"咦？他很崇拜瓦——呃，很崇拜那位女将军吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDB7F031191B6BC80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321404009:1":{"text":"음... 아마도요? 아무튼 기분이 안 좋을 때면 항상 영웅 얼음 조각상을 보러 가거든요.","source_cn":"嗯……我猜是吧？反正他心情不好的时候就会去看英雄冰雕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB428CC31AB5278A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321404010:1":{"text":"형에게 가시는 거면 저도 데려가 주세요! 형이 계속 집에 안 와서 찾으러 갈 생각이었거든요!","source_cn":"你们要去找他的话，可以带上我吗？他一直没回家，我想去找他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x970AD49DB1F66682","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321404011:1":{"text":"좋아요, 같이 가요!","source_cn":"那好吧，你就跟我们一起去吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2E67C6C73C6DE15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"카민스키의 후예를 찾고 있어","source_cn":"我们在找卡明斯基的后裔","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE9ED9AAEDDD323C4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"카민스키의 후예를 찾고 있어","female":"카민스키의 후예를 찾고 있어","variant_male_record_index":"69808","variant_female_record_index":"69809","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"그렇게 생각해도 돼","source_cn":"你可以当我们是","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0E1F2D41B3D42080","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그렇게 생각해도 돼","female":"그렇게 생각해도 돼","variant_male_record_index":"69810","variant_female_record_index":"69811","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小彼得":{"text":"피터","source":"小彼得","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_f